# Ported blog content is intentionally kept byte-for-byte as authored.
#
# Prettier's Markdown formatter treats `*` and `_` as emphasis delimiters, so it
# silently rewrites math that legitimately contains them. For example
# `$i_d^*, i_q^*$` (correct) became `$i_d^_, i_q^_$` (broken), which drops the
# expression out of KaTeX and renders the raw LaTeX as visible text.
#
# It also re-pads Markdown tables, producing a large diff on every ported post.
# Run `scripts/jekyll_to_astro.py` to regenerate these files from source.
